different ways of storing data,

00:23:31.239 --> 00:23:32.530
because we keep on adding more.

00:23:32.530 --> 00:23:35.680
And we had one,
episode 14, I think.

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:38.139
It was like, storage
in the Cloud.

00:23:38.139 --> 00:23:39.805
We should remake that
