00:29:03.510 --> 00:29:06.000
I can tell you that from
a feature point of view,

00:29:06.000 --> 00:29:07.650
we definitely have--

00:29:07.650 --> 00:29:09.570
we're enterprise ready
with the features.

00:29:09.570 --> 00:29:13.144
Like we have IAM, which is
Identity and Access Management,

00:29:13.144 --> 00:29:14.310
in the beta product already.

00:29:14.310 --> 00:29:15.240
We have audit logging.

00:29:15.240 --> 00:29:19.170
We have encryption at rest by
default. We have a JDBC driver.

00:29:19.170 --> 00:29:22.590
As I said, we had SQL, which
is ANSI C 2011 compliant.

00:29:22.590 --> 00:29:24.067
And we have client libraries.

00:29:24.067 --> 00:29:25.650
So we are definitely
enterprise ready.

00:29:25.650 --> 00:29:28.860
But I think any size
company can sort of

00:29:28.860 --> 00:29:31.500
take advantage of these
features without extra effort.

00:29:31.500 --> 00:29:36.820
So it kind of comes free as part
of the system, out of the box.

00:29:36.820 --> 00:29:41.160
And so even if you're a
startup or a small company,

00:29:41.160 --> 00:29:43.560
but your data is your
prized possession,

00:29:43.560 --> 00:29:49.000
it's your business intelligence
or your business strong point,

00:29:49.000 --> 00:29:50.370
then you can start with Spanner.

00:29:50.370 --> 00:29:52.680
And then you don't have
to worry about ever

00:29:52.680 --> 00:29:55.320
having to deal with Scale,
or managing that database,

00:29:55.320 --> 00:29:59.070
or provisioning for
disaster recovery

00:29:59.070 --> 00:30:02.100
by replicating it into
multiple availability zones.

00:30:02.100 --> 00:30:05.720
All of those things come
built in and by default.

00:30:05.720 --> 00:30:08.980
So it has a lot more
than just scalable

00:30:08.980 --> 00:30:10.410
relational database to offer.

00:30:10.410 --> 00:30:12.080
And as I said, it
has high visibility.

00:30:12.080 --> 00:30:13.164
It has high performance.

00:30:13.164 --> 00:30:14.830
It can grow and grow
as your data grows.

00:30:14.830 --> 00:30:15.570
And you don't have
to worry about it.

00:30:15.570 --> 00:30:18.040
You focus on your
business and growing it.

00:30:18.040 --> 00:30:19.784
And we take care of the rest.

